---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for waterheaterrepairmooresvillenc.us explaining how we handle information submitted through our website."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a> <span>/</span> <span>Privacy Policy</span>
      </nav>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>Last updated: November 2025</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          This privacy policy describes how Water Heater Repair Mooresville NC
          (“we,” “us,” or “our”) handles information collected through the website
          waterheaterrepairmooresvillenc.us.
        </p>

        <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>
          When you use our contact form, we collect the information you voluntarily provide,
          such as your name, phone number, email address, and message content. We do not
          require an account to use the site.
        </p>

        <h2>How We Use Information</h2>
        <p>
          We use contact form submissions solely to respond to your service requests and
          questions. We do not sell personal information.
        </p>

        <h2>Form Processing</h2>
        <p>
          Contact form submissions are processed by Web3Forms, a third-party form service.
          Their handling of data is governed by their own privacy practices.
        </p>

        <h2>Cookies and Analytics</h2>
        <p>
          This site may use basic analytics or similar tools in the future to understand
          general traffic patterns. We do not use advertising trackers that build personal
          profiles.
        </p>

        <h2>Third-Party Links</h2>
        <p>
          Our site may contain links to external websites. We are not responsible for the
          privacy practices of those sites.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          If you have questions about this policy, please contact us through the
          <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> or by phone at (704) 555-0123.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this policy from time to time. The “Last updated” date at the top
          of this page will reflect the most recent revision.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
